# The cognition module's KnowledgeProficiency well-formedness obligations (issue #556) are
# authored entirely as logic: core content in slices/core/cognition/module.ttl and projected
# to generated/shapes/validation-shapes.ttl + generated/shapes/procedural-constraints.ttl. This
# file carries no hand-authored sh:NodeShape: every check is a canonical logic: constraint or
# an EL-safe OWL/RDFS axiom whose SHACL image the pipeline derives. The file is retained (not
# deleted) as the stable, intentionally shape-free anchor for the cognition validation
# namespace.
